OL,4,G1600FHuw Stephens
OL,5,     GIt's Friday, so Huw is out to
OL,6,     Gprove that any song sounds better
OL,7,     Gwhen it's played on 6 Music by
OL,8,     GHuw Stephens - so let us know
OL,9,     Gwhat you want to hear.
OL,10,G1900FThe People's Party with Femi
OL,11,     FKoleoso
OL,12,     GFemi restores your faith with a
OL,13,     Gsoulful show full of gospel
OL,14,     Gsounds. The London-born Christian
OL,15,     Grapper Guvna B shares his Friday
OL,16,     GVibe, plus Femi is in the mix for
OL,17,     Gthe last half hour.
OL,18,G2100F6 Music's Indie Forever
OL,19,     GNathan plays back-to-back indie
OL,20,     Gbangers by Future Islands,
OL,21,     GMetronomy and The Kills!
